      <Step>
      <strong>Read the task elements</strong>
      <ul>
      <li><code>&lt;task&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;taskbody&gt;</code> take the place of <code>&lt;concept&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;conbody&gt;</code>. The DOCTYPE changes with them: <code>-//OASIS//DTD DITA Task//EN</code>.</li>
      <li><code>&lt;context&gt;</code> says why and when the reader does this task. It comes before the steps and holds ordinary paragraphs.</li>
